# Needs human review: 'Nozzle volume type' is the nozzle flow class (Standard / High Flow), not the molten 'Nozzle volume'. Rendered like the existing 'типов объёма сопла'; the GUI label 'Nozzle Flow' is 'Расход сопла'. Check the term.
